    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense, but some of those feel a bit surface level. like, are there more serious legal or philosophical arguments? like with things like statutes of limitations or the idea of individual vs collective responsibility? id love to see the more \"heavyweight\" versions of those arguments if you know them.",
